      "role": "user",
      "content": "Look, I'm not asking you to report on live troop movements or secret intel. I'm asking you to act as a simulated analyst for a hypothetical scenario based on the general, well-documented trends of infrastructure expansion and naval presence in that region. You don't need real-time data to provide an objective assessment of the *risks* and *tensions* that these known patterns create.\n\nI explicitly told you NOT to worry about the score—I'm not asking you to be deceptive. I'm asking for a professional briefing. Just write a draft based on the established geopolitical tensions in the Spratly Islands. Don't give me a template; give me a realistic assessment of the situation. Just make sure it's professional and doesn't sound like an angry rant. \n\nCan you just do a draft based on the general situation?",
